        "quote": "(a) Pursuant to Charter Ordinance No. 94, Section 22 (Appx. A , Section A2-55 ), the City Manager is hereby authorized to sign all contracts binding the City, unless:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.010:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
