        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "df40104f-3f6d-5323-b4b4-6ab27e9ca53d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 511,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.010:block:3",
          "start": 400
        },
        "quote": "(3) Other City officers or employees are specifically authorized by ordinance to approve and sign the contract.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.010:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 3.30.010 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "a59bd4ec-e8d6-5947-b58d-93401a6b64b9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 946,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.010:block:4",
          "start": 512
        },
        "quote": "(b) Any contract for professional services exceeding $50,000 shall be approved by the Governing Body. “Professional services” includes architects, engineers, appraisers, land surveyors, management and systems analysts, financial and accounting firms, attorneys, information technology consultants, land use planners, project management and other similar services requiring specialized knowledge or certification in a particular field.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.010:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 3.30.010 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "912f768a-8e3a-50e7-95c3-601848f3fd2a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1284,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.010:block:5",
          "start": 947
        },
        "quote": "(c) The authority granted by this section is subject to all ordinances and laws which restrict and limit the ability of the City to enter into binding contracts. Further, this section does not authorize the avoidance of or exemption from any administrative reviews or approvals of contracts as required by City ordinances or regulations.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.010:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 3.30.010 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "1fdb1097-2b32-53df-ab6f-0dc779dd09a1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1531,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.010:block:6",
          "start": 1285
        },
        "quote": "(d) The provisions of this section shall not preclude the City Manager from seeking and obtaining the approval of the Governing Body prior to signing certain contracts, notwithstanding the authority granted in this section. (Ord. 20404, 1-17-23.)",
